    "title": "Adopt the Interfold Constitution",
    "summary": "An inaugural proposal for the Interfold to adopt a constitution.",
    "creator": "0xd714Dd60e22BbB1cbAFD0e40dE5Cfa7bBDD3F3C8",
    "actions": [],
    "description": "<p>The Interfold has come online. <strong>With this (third attempt at an) inaugural proposal, we sort the first ciphernode committee, and through their participation in the DKG, begin the first E3 \u2014 and by that same act, we seek to adopt the Interfold Constitution.</strong> This short charter that ranks privacy above all, keeps the protocol open, forkable, and opt-in. The canonical text is published with the IPFS CID: bafkreihfytzi7dpuxxcw6ppqmc2otwsmxuodc6fqiccdwqsrvihl6hokx4; upon the successful passing of this proposal, this Constitution takes effect.</p><p>Let the first committee be sorted. Let the first key be generated. Let the first secret ballots be cast. Let the outcome be verified. <em>And, again, if this attempt fails for some reason, as maiden runs of new complex machinery often do, we sort again!</em></p>",
